    "number": "94d18bb5-29cc-51b5-b0c3-70afe2b6f85b.8.25.5",
    "sentence": "就假意推尊楚怀王为义帝，实际上不听从他的命令。",
    "characters": {
      "刘邦": true
    },
    "Original_time_information": {
