  {
    "number": "94d18bb5-29cc-51b5-b0c3-70afe2b6f85b.8.26.2",
    "sentence": "背弃原来的约定，改立沛公为汉王，在巴、蜀、汉中称玉，建都南郑。",
    "characters": {
      "刘邦": true
    },
    "Original_time_information": {
      "exist": false,
      "OTI": ""
    },
